  [timing grade] declared part reaches the AX7101 PLL speed grade, including a changed-part control
test_extra_sweep_clocks:
[clock contract] extra sweep: defaults, all configurations, changed system clock, omitted system clock, board mismatch, invalid clock and missing configuration pass
